"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2919,"Narrated to us by Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-Ala', who said: Narrated to us by Sufyan, on the authority of Abu Najih, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Ibn Abi Layla, from Ali (RA) who said: ""The Prophet (ﷺ) commanded me to stand over his sacrificial camels (badan), to give in charity their skins and their saddles (jalal), and I believe he also said: and their meat."""
